cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the paper below. If you use the foothold
  prediction model or the G1 environments in fpm/, please also cite Watch Your Step.
type: software
title: "Terrain-Grounded Imagination"
abstract: >-
  A recipe for training humanoid locomotion on sparse and rough terrain through
  a world model with differentiable heightmap lookups.
